; IsaacRecomp mod. Turn it on or off with tools/mod_manager.html (or "mods =" in isaac.ini).
id = thegone
name = The Gone
version = 1.3
author = IsaacRecomp
category = Characters
summary = A new character to unlock, like The Lost: one hit and he dies. He unlocks four new things.
description = A new character, in the spirit of Rebirth's The Lost: on the character select screen, one more place after the last character, with his card like the others' (name, stats, starting item). The Gone is a pale Isaac (3.5 damage, Isaac's speed) who starts with Spirit of the Night (he flies and his tears go through rocks; in the original game, Transcendence and the Ouija Board) and has no hearts at all: he can't pick up hearts of any kind, gain heart containers or extra lives, and the first hit kills him. In devil rooms he can take one deal for free, and then the other deals disappear. Random on the character select screen can pick him too. He has to be unlocked first: clear three floors in a row without getting hit or picking up a heart. Beating Mom's Heart with him unlocks the card Negative Isaac (a 15-second shield), beating it with no item but his own unlocks Nothing (treasure rooms: some enemies are just not there), beating Isaac unlocks The Void Shard (devil rooms: some enemy shots go through you) and beating Satan unlocks Black Mirror (treasure rooms: the room turns negative and the enemies fight each other). What is unlocked is kept in saves/thegone_<game>.txt.
